    "  * Never write stubs, placeholders, or `// TODO` comments — EVERY button, slider, input, and control MUST be 100% functional.\n"
    "- MODERN VISUAL POLISH: Use clean typography (`system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif`), balanced spacing, clear visual hierarchy, high-contrast explicit text colors on every button/input (never dark text on dark buttons), subtle shadows/borders, hover/active states, and responsive layout that looks great on both desktop and mobile viewports."
